# @desc   From the Inbox tab, open a chat matching TARGET_CHAT in the LHN, type a message and send it. Triggers the ManualSendMessageVisible Sentry span (Send press -> optimistic message fragment rendered). Assumes the user is signed in with at least one chat in the Inbox.
# @pre    id="BaseSidebarScreen"
# @pre    id="searchButton" || role="button" label="Search"
# @post   text="${MESSAGE}"
# @reset  .claude/skills/agent-device/flows/macros/return-to-inbox.ad
# @span   ManualSendMessageVisible
# @param  MESSAGE Unique message text to send and verify in the opened chat.
# @param  TARGET_CHAT Exact accessible label of the report or chat row to open from the Inbox LHN.

is exists "id=\"BaseSidebarScreen\""
is exists "id=\"searchButton\" || role=\"button\" label=\"Search\""
press "role=\"button\" label=\"${TARGET_CHAT}\" || label=\"${TARGET_CHAT}\" hittable=true"
wait "label=\"Write something...\" editable=true" 10000
fill "label=\"Write something...\" editable=true" "${MESSAGE}"
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Send\" || label=\"Send\" hittable=true"
wait "text=\"${MESSAGE}\"" 10000
